+### Save backups to Google Drive (`src/cloud_*.c`)
+
+The helper backs up changed saves on its own every `interval_min` minutes: a local copy under
+`/data/ps5upload/save-backups/<user>/<title>/<stamp>_sync/` (the console page's layout), then a tar of
+it to the user's Google Drive over HTTPS (mbedTLS 3.6 in `third_party/mbedtls`, Google's roots only).
+Sign-in is the OAuth device flow with the user's own client; the token lives in `/data/ps5upload/gdrive`,
+which `path_policy.c` denies like the SMB secrets. Routes: `webui_cloud.h`. Setup and design:
+[`../GOOGLE_DRIVE_BACKUP.md`](../GOOGLE_DRIVE_BACKUP.md).
+
